# Shared config for the blog tooling — the ONE place the vault path lives.
# Sourced by sync_obsidian-to-astro.sh and read by scripts/new-post.mjs so both
# point at the same Obsidian vault. Plain KEY=VALUE (no shell expansion) so bash
# and Node parse it identically.
#
# An already-set BLOG_SOURCE environment variable OVERRIDES this file (CI, other
# machines, Oliveros's automation): `BLOG_SOURCE=/path npm run new-post ...`.
BLOG_SOURCE=/Users/danielramirez/Nextcloud/ore/Notes/Project/hugo-content
